---PAGE supage
---LINES
stdfile	= c ".ashstd"
vexdir  = v    -       -       cvt_sp  -       vexdir
hl      = gc    -       -       cvt_hl  -       "-"
f       = ipv   -       -       -       -       f
i       = ipv   -       -       -       -       i
o       = ipv   -       -       -       -       o

panl    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       pF
scrl    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       sF
hist    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       hF
clck    = ipa   -       onoff   cvt_a   -       cF
ymax    = ipv   -       "%4d"   -       t_ymax  yy_max
---SCREEN
=help for setup

  each flag can be changed with ."selector".
  please, press .:HE.... again to get generic help about keyboard and screen

flags:
."history save". - command history will be saved on exit from vash
."scroll"....... - scroll the command output if checked, otherwise clear screen
."clock"........ - show current time at the right top of the screen
		    on the end of the every command
."keybar"....... - show description of keys 0-9 at the bottom of the screen
."who+cwd"...... - who and current working directory shown on scren and/or
		    on xterm window title
."lines max".... - maximum lines for main menu will on the screen, on change,
		    please, use .'= or .'U or .:NL.... to force rescan main menu

."setup for debug only". - it is better to don't touch if not sure
    full description is in comments of .stdfile

    maxli/maxco - current size of the screen, maximum lines/columns
---END
